{
  "id": "DEU.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 8",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida miy jea eehearan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Diigheanyeeka sean eagoonyeey ghamneawa gajasisiina mureeda aba badiida, ak abeeda gajanyasa giibinda nea ghoahaada jeacheengeagwa, ak gajaweayeena jeeda ng'eanyiida aksa habeawooda NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba gayghoadaw ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajapkaada naweeda sean abeada NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U adoabiiweagwa aba gweanyeew haradam aba jeeda dareapcheeda, nea ghwahiing'neey, ak gwasimsimnyi ghwadaah gida mida jeeda gurooroadaang'u, ghwadaah ea jea sisiina mureeda diigheanyeekaaschi ghana manda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaminighisnyi, ak gabarseey jalooda, ak gagoonyi maana, hamita minali ang'iing'i ea ghweanigaagu, ghoahiimneey gideaba siida mwoamu ghwanyas eaweega aba agita mukaate ak ghwahit, geeghus ng'asheanda leabu ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeaba gweanyeeksu was bughalaan hang'weaka badahuukeagwa miigameewa nea eara geeshangeagwa ea mii goopkeani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nala aba gurooroadaang'u gideaba, siida iiyamu goorgweaksa jeaptaanyi, hean eara NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygoorgweaksiineey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida miy jea eembali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweaksiinda jea ea maroosiina fih NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Afura geat adiidu gwarooseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, iimoang'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi ea deaweedajeagaaschi ea huumeanyeakaaschi, earukuneey ghamneawean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iiniyeagiischi ak ea nilang'uudi, nea nideasi gealga miyaasiin ak giibiidi jeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda dugwaagu ea noagaagu gayghwasaang'ayiit, nea lapiya ea lagheangaagu meeng'meeng'i gayghwasaang'ayiit, ea haleanjeeda sean indeawi gayghoahaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda adiidu gighwari geaw, ea gwarooseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aruuteaweey jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, jeeda gheeda soomjeandumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoabiiwnyi aba jeeda dareapcheeda haw haloat, mida ichipkeega mideawa furooda ea udagilbajeega ea ng'eanyiida ghajaam manda beega, hean gwanyakneey beega aruuna jeeda lagheaneeda hang'waay ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghoang'aataneey aba hamita siguura maana aba jeeda dareapcheeda nea ghweanigeagwa ea mwanala, hean ghwanung' nyasa hang'weanidooda nea gwasimnyi, muchu ak gagoonyi alooheeda aba huuydeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shageada adiidu gwayi gurooroadaang'u, ‘Uurdeanyu ea geatindeanyu gwanyaknean baruureeni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajapkaada NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aba gideaba gagoonyi niny uurda inyasi baruureega, abeeda gayghoahang'waay neajeadaanyi heeleesa ghweanigaagu, ghoah giduurji ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba inyas gwarooseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak giyamsi geaw aseecheeka suurja nea gibwadi, aniini aba huumwa gearukuneegwa gideaba gajooshealana askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji eemoojigiga las uhuuda NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeedeang'wean, hean eara agooga gajooshealana, aba gideaba ghoaheawi ooleeysiina iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
